Package: av1converter
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Francesco Micheli
Depends: ffmpeg
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/framicheli/av1converter
Description: Batch-convert video files to AV1 using FFmpeg
 AV1Converter provides an interactive terminal UI and a local web UI for
 managing FFmpeg encoding, track selection, and quality verification.
